course: dictionary
lesson: 1842
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. Cock is a good example. Read the words around it to find out which meaning the writer wants. The context is the clue.
explain: «Peter said three times that he did not know Jesus; then the cock crowed and he wept.» Here a cock is a bird. Cocks crow at dawn, so the words crowed and dawn tell you the meaning is a male chicken.
explain: «The dog cocked its head when it heard a noise.» Now cock is a verb. The dog lifted and tilted its head to listen. Cock can also be a noun or a verb in other sentences, so always check the words around it.
explain: Some meanings of cock are rude, and they should never be used at school. If you hear one, do not repeat it. Ask a grown-up, or look the word up in a dictionary together.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: A cock is an adult male chicken, also called a rooster.
fact: To cock your head or ear means to tilt it or lift it, often to listen.
fact: A noun names a thing; a verb is a doing word. Cock can be both.
fact: «Cocorico» is the French sound for a cock-a-doodle-doo, and «coin-coin» is the French sound for a quack.
exercise: «The cock crowed at dawn.» What is a cock in this sentence? | * A male chicken, also called a rooster | A type of farm gate | A female hen that lays eggs | A small dog
exercise: «The dog cocked its head when it heard a noise.» What does cocked mean here? | Lay down to sleep | * Tilted and lifted, to listen | Barked loudly | Shook hard
exercise: In French, cocorico is the sound of which animal? | Dog | * Cock | Cow | Cat
test: «Peter said three times that he did not know Jesus; then the cock crowed and he wept.» In this sentence, what does the cock do? | Barks | * Crows | Moos | Lays eggs
test: Is cock a noun or a verb in «The cock crowed at dawn»? | Adjective, because it describes the dawn | * Noun, because it names the bird | Verb, because it shows an action | Adverb, because it tells how the bird crowed
exam: Which French word is the sound a cock makes? | miaou | * cocorico | meuh | coin-coin
